  "instance_name": "mapping_1",
  "label": "tragedy mapped to pun",
  "description": "The visual material of the 9/11 attacks (World Trade Center towers in flames) is mapped onto the textual pun 'plane hilarious' to create a dark, insensitive joke. The text 'but their just, plane hilarious' uses the word 'plane' (as in airplane) to mock the gravity of the event, implying the tragedy is 'just plane hilarious'. This mapping trivializes the horrific visual by equating it with a pun, thereby creating a harmful analogical relationship between the visual tragedy and the textual joke.",
